OL,3,GNEWSARoad 'to be closed for hours'
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA main road in Bristol could be closed
OL,7,Ffor hours because of a road accident,
OL,8,Fpolice have said.
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called to the incident, involving
OL,12,Fa single vehicle, on Greystoke Avenue
OL,13,Fat about 13:40 BST on Tuesday.
OL,14,FEmergency services are on the scene.
OL,16,FGreystoke Avenue and surrounding roads
OL,17,Fincluding Ullswater Road and Trowbridge
OL,18,FRoad are closed.
OL,20,FDiversions are in place and the
OL,21,Femergency services remain at the scene.
